      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bayou_La_Batre%2C_Alabama",
      "category": "economy",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "In 2005, Disney built the Black Pearl pirate ship in Bayou La Batre for the Pirates of the Caribbean sequels.",
